give @s written_book{title:"Culling",author:"lollip0529",pages:['["", {"text": "Culling\\n\\n", "bold": true}, "Why the portal room\'s spawner doesn\'t spike in the pie from where you start.\\n\\nThe game only draws what it finds by looking through open air, one 16x16x16 block cube at a time."]','["", {"text": "Too far (64+)", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nSpawners only show in the pie within 64 blocks of you. This one is farther, so it won\'t render until you get closer."]','["", {"text": "Directionality", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe game checks each cube only once, from the first side it reaches. Unlike horizontal, nothing doubles back: a closer cube is just reached from the wrong side first. No sure fix: move, or look up or down to hide the wrong way."]','["", {"text": "Vertical culling", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nOnce the game has looked down it can\'t look back up, and the other way round. The way to the spawner goes up or down and has to come back, so it\'s missed. Change your Y level past a multiple of 16 (like Y 32)."]','["", {"text": "Horizontal culling", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nLike vertical, but sideways: once the game has looked east it can\'t look back west, and the same for north and south. The way to the spawner doubles back sideways, so it gets missed. It can spike from the next chunk over."]','["", {"text": "Lack of air", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe air near the portal room doesn\'t join up with the air near you in a way the game can follow, so it never finds the spawner, whichever way it looks."]','["", {"text": "Flush hidden", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThere is no open air at all between you and the spawner: solid blocks close off the way in. Check the 5-way for hiddens that are flush with chunk borders."]','["", {"text": "Chunk border", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nIt\'s hidden where you stand, but walk into the next chunk on the same level and it spikes. Often that\'s only a step or two away."]','["", {"text": "Angle (EyeZoom too narrow)", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nThe game only looks at what is on your screen. EyeZoom shows such a thin slice that the spawner never spikes there, whichever way you turn. Thin can be too narrow as well, so check on Thin or at 30 FOV."]','["", {"text": "Ghost spike", "bold": true}, "\\n\\nIt spikes, but only when you face away from the portal room. Leaving out what\'s off screen can open up another way to it. Confirm the spike from a second spot before sending it."]']}
